g state and it gets cancelled. \r\nThis is a guess only, not a final diagnosis.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/comments/1270355638/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"kovan","id":217326,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNzMyNg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217326?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kovan","html_url":"https://github.com/kovan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kovan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kovan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kovan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kovan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kovan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kovan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kovan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kovan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kovan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/comments/1355515155","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc/issues/31227#issuecomment-1355515155","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/31227","id":1355515155,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAacf2M5Qy4UT","user":{"login":"gnossen","id":1644595,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDQ1OTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1644595?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen","html_url":"https://github.com/gnossen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-12-16T19:55:35Z","updated_at":"2022-12-16T19:55:35Z","body":"This code\r\n\r\n```python\r\ndef foo():\r\n    return 3\r\n\r\na = foo()\r\n```\r\n\r\nresults in this bytecode:\r\n\r\n```\r\n  0           0 RESUME                   0\r\n\r\n  1           2 LOAD_CONST               0 (<code object foo at 0x5614c2e6bfc0, file \"example.py\", line 1>)\r\n              4 MAKE_FUNCTION            0\r\n              6 STORE_NAME               0 (foo)\r\n\r\n  4           8 PUSH_NULL\r\n             10 LOAD_NAME                0 (foo)\r\n             12 PRECALL                  0\r\n             16 CALL                     0\r\n             26 STORE_NAME               1 (a)\r\n             28 LOAD_CONST               1 (None)\r\n             30 RETURN_VALUE\r\n\r\nDisassembly of <code object foo at 0x5614c2e6bfc0, file \"example.py\", line 1>:\r\n  1           0 RESUME                   0\r\n\r\n  2           2 LOAD_CONST               1 (3)\r\n              4 RETURN_VALUE\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf `foo()` raises an exception, the `STORE_NAME` instruction is never executed. I assume something similar is happening here.\r\n\r\nBut if we've reached [this line](https://github.com/grpc/grpc/blob/9e7c8bff5518cf86ab61210589b0bfca8cbc64c7/src/python/grpcio/grpc/aio/_call.py#L346), that would mean that we made it through [this call](https://github.com/grpc/grpc/blob/9e7c8bff5518cf86ab61210589b0bfca8cbc64c7/src/python/grpcio/grpc/aio/_call.py#L344) without an exception being raised. But this implies that [we received a status code of `OK`](https://github.com/grpc/grpc/blob/9e7c8bff5518cf86ab61210589b0bfca8cbc64c7/src/python/grpcio/grpc/aio/_call.py#L235), which is quite odd considering that there was an exception when receiving the message.\r\n\r\nCan you please add any more logs you might have? Setting the following environment variables would also help us debug this issue:\r\n\r\n```\r\nexport GRPC_VERBOSITY=DEBUG\r\nexport GRPC_TRACE=all,-timer,-timer_check\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/comments/1355515155/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"gnossen","id":1644595,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDQ1OTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1644595?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen","html_url":"https://github.com/gnossen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":8059492652,"node_id":"LE_lADOAacf2M5TL3g_zwAAAAHgYhks","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/events/8059492652","actor":{"login":"gnossen","id":1644595,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDQ1OTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1644595?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen","html_url":