epos/grpc/grpc/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/deployments","created_at":"2014-12-08T18:58:53Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T01:04:12Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-12T17:45:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/grpc/grpc.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:grpc/grpc.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc","homepage":"https://grpc.io","size":589086,"stargazers_count":44070,"watchers_count":44070,"language":"C++","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":11011,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1158,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":11011,"open_issues":1158,"watchers":44070,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/pulls/31982","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc/pull/31982","diff_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc/pull/31982.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc/pull/31982.patch","merged_at":"2023-01-04T01:36:07Z"},"body":"This is motivated by #31227 which I also encountered recently. I'm not familiar with the call lifecycle details, but it seems clear that there is some kind of race condition between user-initiated cancellations and other completion status updates.\r\n\r\nIf a user cancels a call before being notified of its completion, I believe it should be considered cancelled unconditionally, regardless of whether the call actually completed successfully before its cancellation status could be set.\r\n\r\nSo it seems better to re-raise explicitly rather than using `self._raise_for_status()`, which is a no-op in this race condition and can lead to an `UnboundedLocalError`.\r\n\r\nAlso related: #30568\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/31982/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/31982/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/comments/1365613671","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc/issues/31227#issuecomment-1365613671","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/31227","id":1365613671,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAacf2M5RZZxn","user":{"login":"njhill","id":16958488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2OTU4NDg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16958488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill","html_url":"https://github.com/njhill","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-12-27T05:03:10Z","updated_at":"2022-12-27T05:03:10Z","body":"I also ran into this with 1.51.1, appears to be a race condition and I have proposed a fix in #31982.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/comments/1365613671/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"njhill","id":16958488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2OTU4NDg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16958488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill","html_url":"https://github.com/njhill","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/comments/1370391969","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc/issues/31227#issuecomment-1370391969","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/31227","id":1370391969,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAacf2M5RroWh","user":{"login":"gnossen","id":1644595,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDQ1OTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1644595?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen","html_url":"https://github.com/gnossen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-01-04T01:30:51Z","updated_at":"2023-01-04T01:30:51Z","body":"It took me a while to figure out exactly what was going on here, but after finally reproducing it, I think I have a clear picture:\r\n\r\n- The cancellation has to happen while [this call](https://github.com/grpc/grpc/blob/9e7c8bff5518cf86ab61210589b0bfca8cbc64c7/src/python/grpcio/grpc/aio/_call.py#L340) is in progress.\r\n- A response with status code OK has to be received by the time [this line](https://github.com/grpc/grpc/blob/9e7c8bff5518cf86ab61210589b0bfca8cbc64c7/src/python/grpcio/grpc/aio/_call.py#L342) executes \r\n- [`self.cancel`](https://github.com/grpc/grpc/blob/9e7c8bff5518cf86ab61210589b0bfca8cbc64c7/src/python/grpcio/grpc/aio/_call.py#L343) is not called because [`self.cancelled()`](https://github.com/grpc/grpc/blob/9e7c8bff5518cf86ab61210589b0bfca8cbc64c7/src/python/grpcio/grpc/aio/_call.py#L342) returns False because it hasn't been manually cancelled and [it hasn't received a `CANCELLED` status](https://github.com/grpc/grpc/blob/a414dbd304aa14c7066a110e2ce4e6e1ff748fcf/src/python/grpcio/grpc/_cython/_cygrpc/aio/call.pyx.pxi#L233)\r\n- `_raise_for_status` doesn't raise `asyncio.CancelledError` [here](https://github.com/grpc/grpc/blob/a414dbd304aa14c7066a110e2ce4e6e1ff748fcf/src/python/grpcio/grpc/aio/_call.py#L233) (as it was expected to) because `is_locally_cancelled` is False because we never called `call.cancel()` for the above mentioned reasons.\r\n\r\n@njhill I think your PR is the right solution to this and I now have a (seemingly) deterministic unit test showing that it fixes the problem.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/comments/1370391969/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"gnossen","id":1644595,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDQ1OTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1644595?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen","html_url":"https://github.com/gnossen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnossen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":8147209760,"node_id":"MEE_lADOAacf2M5TL3g_zwAAAAHlnI4g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/events/8147209760","actor":{"login":"njhill","id":16958488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2OTU4NDg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16958488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/njhill","html_url":"ht